  <prompt>Write an integration test at src/solutions/Notepad/src/__integration__/notepad.integration.test.tsx covering the full round trip: create memo → type body → save (Ctrl+Enter, blur, debounce) → switch via list → info popover. Mocks Xrm.WebApi.</prompt>

